---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How HappyCake handles your contact details."
>
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <p class="cake-name-label text-happy-blue-500 mb-2">◆ Privacy</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl text-happy-blue-900 leading-tight mb-4">
      Your contact details, kept simple.
    </h1>

    <div class="prose-like text-text-primary text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-3">
      <p>
        We use the contact info you give us at checkout, on the lead form, or via
        WhatsApp/Instagram only to bake your cake, confirm the pickup or delivery,
        and follow up if there's a problem with the order.
      </p>
      <p>
        We don't sell or share your details with third parties. We don't run
        background trackers on this site. The chat widget and the storefront talk
        only to our own backend.
      </p>
      <p>
        Marketing follow-ups (the rare WhatsApp reminder, the seasonal email) are
        opt-in only. Reply STOP to anything we send and we stop.
      </p>
      <p>
        Questions? Send us a WhatsApp message at <a href="https://wa.me/12815550100" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-happy-blue-500 underline">+1 (281) 979-8320</a>
        or visit the shop at 350 Promenade Way, Sugar Land, TX.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
